<table border=0 cellpadding=1 cellspacing=0 width=100%><td nowrap>
<font size=3 color=#606060><strong>▽</strong> 2003/11/25 (火) 21:39:38 <strong>▽</strong> 運営委員 </font></td>
<td nowrap align=right><font size=3>　<a href="bbs.cgi?res=200311252213938&log=ashikaga">返信</a>　削除<input type=checkbox name="target" value="200311252213938"></font>
